                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I\u2019m proud to serve in Congress to help bring resources back to our #MN01 communities. This week, I met with Mayor John Whittington and Jennifer Bromeland from Eagle Lake to hear about their city\u2019s water treatment improvement project and discuss opportunities to partner in delivering infrastructure investments for their residents.",
