                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "In Congress, my top priority is advocating for the needs of our #MN01 communities. My office recently helped the @cityofalbertlea secure $1,000,000 in federal funding for much-needed wastewater treatment facility improvements. I enjoyed visiting with Mayor Rich Murray and city staff this week to talk about the many ways we can continue to make a difference for Albert Lea\u2019s residents.",
