                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "Last week, I had the opportunity to hear from the folks at Recovery in Motion and see firsthand the dedication they show to helping our neighbors in need of recovery. While touring their treatment center in Fairmont, we talked about ways we can ensure policies at the federal level best serve the organizations that administer substance use disorder treatment services, as well as our community members who rely on them.",
