                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Too often, outdated restrictions limit Medicaid coverage for mental health treatment. I am excited to introduce the Restoring Inpatient Mental Health Access Act of 2025, which will expand access to inpatient care, helping those in crisis receive the treatment they need while easing the burden on emergency rooms and local jails.",
